	(text "HARDWARE TIMEOUT (74HCT4538 @ 5V)\nRelay ON = GPIO high AND < T since rising edge\nT = 0.7 x R3 x C5 = 0.7 x 1M x 10uF = ~7 s (PulseTime 3-3.5 s)\nR9/R10 1k: protect ESP GPIO if 5V rail is off (USB only)\nR11/R12 100R: TI rapid power-down protection for CX\nR7/R8 220R: limit relay opto input current (~5 mA)"
